FADE IN:

INT. MOUNTAIN OPERATIONS ROOM - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

LENKA
(serious)
The command complex is coordinating unmanned artillery across the whole front. The uplink is its weak point.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

COMMANDER SAVA
(measured)
Destroying the main building first will leave the batteries active. We must cut their eyes and power.

PETROV
(firm)
Disable the power relays, destroy the uplink, then take the central compound before the barrage begins.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
